     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Jumbo Jive is the largest piece in our Clown Capade series. This multi-colour circus playground has several jester-hat towers, tube slides and a yellow slide, along with a climbing wall, rope bridges, a tunnel climber and a swing set. It is built for children aged 3 to 12, so toddlers can stay on the lower parts while older children cross the bridges. Play includes climbing, sliding, hanging and swinging. The product area is 43'11\" x 32'4\" and the safe play area is 47'11\" x 38'4\". That puts it in the range of public parks, large townships and resorts. Capacity is listed as 15 children. Every galvanised pipe, roto-moulded part, composite laminate and play rope on Jumbo Jive has a 3-year warranty. We can work out a layout that leaves space for parents' seating around it."
     }
